Original commit body from 8271cba:

Source Files are now sorted by symbol importance density (sum of raw
in-degrees / LOC), surfacing the most interconnected files first.

All Files section is renamed to Additional Files and uses hybrid ordering:
- Top N files (configurable, default 3) by semantic similarity to 5W1H
  probes using ModernBERT embeddings
- Remaining files by symbol mention centrality (word-boundary matching)

New functions in ranking.py:
- compute_raw_in_degree: raw edge counts for symbols
- compute_file_loc: line count for files
- compute_symbol_importance_density: in-degree sum / LOC
- compute_symbol_mention_centrality: symbol mentions in non-source files

New embedding infrastructure in sketch_embeddings.py:
- 5W1H probes for semantic file ranking
- File embedding using 3 random 800-char samples from first third
- Cache support in .hypergumbo_cache/ directory
- ModernBERT with 256-dim truncation

Analysis is now run earlier in generate_sketch to enable density-based
source file ordering.
